                    <lb n="B1"/><hi rend="grantha">svasti śrī</hi> <supplied reason="undefined"><g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g></supplied> tiripuvaṉaccakkaravattikaḷ <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi> I<hi rend="grantha">rājarāja</hi>tevarkku yāṇṭu <num value="26"><unclear>2 <g type="numeral">10</g></unclear> 6 ja</num>yaṅkoṇṭacoḻavaḷanāṭṭu Ākkūrnāṭṭu Ampaṉāṭu Uḷpaṭa<unclear>meviya tirukkaṭa</unclear>vūr Uṭaiyār <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi> kālakālatevar koyil Āticaṇṭe<hi rend="grantha">śva</hi>ra tevarkaṉmikaḷukku I
